WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:05.672
Aleksander:
They were warning me be careful.
This is too big for you.

00:00:06.631 --> 00:00:09.634
Tariq:
There are rumors related to
something called a super league project.

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:13.179
That would flip the power
structures of the world's most
popular sport.

00:00:13.638 --> 00:00:16.975
I'm the president of the most
powerful sports organization in
the world.

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:21.688
Narrator:
It’s a community. A community.
Community.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:26.151
Man:
It's a quasi religion where we
go to the stadium rather than the church.

00:00:27.235 --> 00:00:30.655
Man:
But this vast inequality, had
been growing for ten years.

00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:35.118
Man:
The rich getting richer, running
away from the rest, leaving them with crumbs.

00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:38.371
♪♪

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:40.206
Man:
The owners were used to be being
local.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:42.667
Man:
To succeed now you have to be
owned by a small country.

00:00:42.667 --> 00:00:44.335
♪♪

00:00:44.335 --> 00:00:45.962
Tariq:
More money has meant more
problems.

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:50.091
Reporter:
Europe's leading football clubs
have joined together, to form a breakaway super league.

00:00:50.091 --> 00:00:51.926
♪♪

00:00:51.926 --> 00:00:53.720
Agnelli:
You should look for better
solutions.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.472
Something which is well done can
be done better.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:01.102
The younger generation, they
want to see the big matches, and they want to see the drama.

00:01:01.102 --> 00:01:01.853
♪♪

00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:04.439
Aleksander:
I was obviously blind because he
was my friend.

00:01:04.939 --> 00:01:06.941
I realized that it's a betrayal.

00:01:06.941 --> 00:01:08.193
♪♪

00:01:08.193 --> 00:01:14.532
The most powerful clubs wanted
to build a future of football
that they wholly owned and wholly controlled.

00:01:14.532 --> 00:01:18.203
Roger:
Eliminating hundreds of
competing teams just with the stroke of a pen.

00:01:19.037 --> 00:01:23.208
Aleksander:
If this super league would
happen, the development of football would stop.

00:01:23.917 --> 00:01:27.462
Agnelli:
I am in love with the games.
With the passion of the games. I am in love with

00:01:27.462 --> 00:01:30.924
winning the games, but I am not
in love with the governance.

00:01:31.132 --> 00:01:33.968
Aleksander:
Big countries, big politics, big
business.

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:35.970
Narrator:
This sport, it's been hijacked.

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:37.222
♪♪

00:01:37.222 --> 00:01:39.891
Aleksander:
Now the war for football has
started.

00:01:39.891 --> 00:01:46.272
♪♪

